# Real/synthetic data files — never commit real production data.
*.csv
*.csv.gz
*.gz
data/

# Only the generator script is tracked; the fixture files it produces
# (regardless of buf_size) are regenerated on demand via `make fixtures` /
# generate_test_files.py and are not committed. (Note: two small
# already-committed fixtures from an earlier round, boundary_64.csv[.gz] /
# control_64.csv[.gz], remain tracked — .gitignore only affects untracked
# files, so this exception list intentionally does not re-exempt fixture
# CSVs from the blanket *.csv/*.csv.gz exclusion above.)
!tests/fixtures/generate_test_files.py

